WEBVTT

00:00:00.640 --> 00:00:01.890
It is the period of warring states.{these top three lines were from previous ep and should not be changed or edited}{line taken from Sage's sub}

00:00:01.890 --> 00:00:04.190
The era of competing warlords.{line taken from Sage's sub}

00:00:04.190 --> 00:00:10.950
Many of these daimyou clashed blades ruthlessly,
aiming for conquest of the country.{line taken from Sage's sub}

00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:18.080
Once again, the world
would grow more tumultuous.

00:00:20.290 --> 00:00:23.580
It will all lead up to Sekigahara.{line taken from Sage's sub}

00:00:37.140 --> 00:00:40.560
<b>It is almost two point
five decades since I was born</b>

00:00:40.560 --> 00:00:42.930
<b>I've had so many of jellos so far</b>

00:00:42.930 --> 00:00:45.730
<b>and how many more will I swallow from now on?</b>

00:00:45.730 --> 00:00:49.190
<b>I've already taken tons of exams</b>

00:00:49.190 --> 00:00:51.650
<b>and what else is coming up to me from now on?</b>

00:00:51.650 --> 00:00:54.820
<b>Daily lives must pass by quickly
without any "likes" and "hates"</b>

00:00:54.820 --> 00:00:56.490
<b>That girl who falls for guys easily,</b>

00:00:56.490 --> 00:00:58.950
<b>fell for another one then another
one and another one each time</b>

00:00:58.950 --> 00:01:00.370
<b>For a guy without such experience</b>

00:01:00.370 --> 00:01:04.620
<b>Everyday life now is like a stormy river</b>

00:01:04.620 --> 00:01:05.830
<b>So fast!</b>

00:01:08.790 --> 00:01:10.130
<b>Break out!</b>

00:01:12.460 --> 00:01:18.510
<b>(so) I sing to myself before I get sunk</b>

00:01:18.510 --> 00:01:23.390
<b>I jumped out to stop the streaming days</b>

00:01:23.390 --> 00:01:29.940
<b>The coastline I ran on that strong sunny day
(Shore line I ran)</b>

00:01:29.940 --> 00:01:34.610
<b>If you wanna take back that feeling
(take back that feeling)</b>

00:01:34.610 --> 00:01:38.870
<b>That feeling and give it a deep color of your own self
(take back that feeling)</b>

00:01:38.870 --> 00:01:41.780
<b>First, smash down that door</b>

00:01:58.470 --> 00:02:01.810
Vagabond, they're scared of you.

00:02:01.810 --> 00:02:04.690
That's you they're scared of, Western Sea.

00:02:04.690 --> 00:02:07.270
The very visage of an ogre, as they say.

00:02:11.530 --> 00:02:12.360
What?!

00:02:12.360 --> 00:02:14.160
Lord Masamune.

00:02:14.160 --> 00:02:16.370
Maeda Keiji and Chosokabe Motochika

00:02:16.370 --> 00:02:18.580
have reportedly come to see Tokugawa.

00:02:18.580 --> 00:02:21.580
They're sure making a
big fuss over two measly visitors.

00:02:21.580 --> 00:02:23.460
If Chosokabe is here...

00:02:23.460 --> 00:02:26.420
Maybe he knows about that thing.

00:02:26.420 --> 00:02:29.210
What should we do? Make a run for it?

00:02:30.090 --> 00:02:31.210
Hmm...

00:02:31.210 --> 00:02:33.090
Maybe a bad idea...

00:02:40.310 --> 00:02:43.390
It has been a while, Motochika.

00:02:43.390 --> 00:02:46.100
Ieyasu, I...

00:02:46.100 --> 00:02:49.110
Come on! Get it together, Western Sea!

00:02:49.110 --> 00:02:51.190
R-R-Right.

00:02:51.190 --> 00:02:53.530
I want to ask you something.

00:02:53.530 --> 00:02:55.240
Answer me this, Ieyasu!

00:02:55.240 --> 00:03:00.080
The one who killed Shikoku...
killed my sons-of-bitches... Was it you?!

00:03:00.080 --> 00:03:02.750
What are you talking about?

00:03:02.750 --> 00:03:04.660
Don't play dumb!

00:03:13.630 --> 00:03:16.430
If it wasn't you, then who was it?!

00:03:16.430 --> 00:03:18.340
Motochika.

00:03:18.340 --> 00:03:20.100
What in the world happened?

00:03:21.180 --> 00:03:22.640
As for that...

00:03:22.640 --> 00:03:25.690
Might be quicker if you asked these guys.

00:03:26.850 --> 00:03:31.860
Darkness

00:03:33.150 --> 00:03:36.780
Am I to understand that you men
launched an attack against Shikoku?

00:03:36.780 --> 00:03:39.070
N-Nothing so outrageous...

00:03:39.070 --> 00:03:40.620
They said we could make some money,

00:03:40.620 --> 00:03:41.990
so we just sold them some banners.

00:03:41.990 --> 00:03:44.370
We never dreamed they'd
use them to attack Shikoku...

00:03:44.370 --> 00:03:45.580
You bastards!

00:03:45.580 --> 00:03:48.080
The wild ginger banner is the
pride of Mikawa! How dare you?!

00:03:48.080 --> 00:03:50.130
W-We are so sorry!

00:03:50.130 --> 00:03:51.920
Sold them?

00:03:51.920 --> 00:03:53.170
Eh?

00:03:53.170 --> 00:03:54.300
To whom?!

00:03:54.300 --> 00:03:55.800
Th-That's...

00:03:55.800 --> 00:03:59.590
You guys'll be better off
if you just spill your guts.

00:03:59.590 --> 00:04:01.970
I-It was Mori of Aki.

00:04:03.140 --> 00:04:05.890
M-Mori?!

00:04:07.640 --> 00:04:11.860
Motochika, this was the
misconduct of Tokugawa soldiers.

00:04:11.860 --> 00:04:13.230
The responsibility lies with me

00:04:13.230 --> 00:04:16.070
for only looking outwards and
not at what was happening right here.

00:04:16.070 --> 00:04:19.110
Cut me down! You have that right!

00:04:24.620 --> 00:04:30.420
What pisses me off isn't even Mori!
Never mind you, Ieyasu!

00:04:30.420 --> 00:04:34.340
It's my own foolishness for having
fallen for it hook, line, and sinker!

00:04:34.340 --> 00:04:36.760
I'm sorry, you sons-of-bitches!

00:04:36.760 --> 00:04:38.880
I'm sorry!

00:04:40.640 --> 00:04:43.510
Lady O-Ichi, is it?

00:04:43.510 --> 00:04:47.520
Yes, the younger sister of the late Devil King.

00:04:47.520 --> 00:04:50.690
Tokugawa abducted her person.

00:04:50.690 --> 00:04:52.270
Lord Tokugawa did?

00:04:52.270 --> 00:04:56.320
This is where we would like the Takeda to help.

00:04:56.320 --> 00:04:59.360
We would like for you to rescue Lady O-Ichi.

00:04:59.360 --> 00:05:01.530
Rescue Lady O-Ichi...

00:05:01.530 --> 00:05:05.450
The Devil King's younger sister
and the Supreme Ruler's Left Hand...

00:05:05.450 --> 00:05:07.660
It will surely become clear

00:05:07.660 --> 00:05:11.040
which side has the legitimate
claim to rule this country.

00:05:11.040 --> 00:05:15.960
Be that as it may, I do not know
if we alone can sneak into Sunpu Castle...

00:05:15.960 --> 00:05:19.300
No, you will not be alone.

00:05:20.510 --> 00:05:23.970
We shall have the pleasure
of accompanying you as well.

00:05:23.970 --> 00:05:26.850
The Venerable Tenkai,
adviser to the Western Forces,

00:05:26.850 --> 00:05:29.180
and Master Isono of the Oda Army.

00:05:29.180 --> 00:05:31.640
Lady O-Ichi is our lady and mistress.

00:05:31.640 --> 00:05:34.690
We cannot allow Tokugawa
to do as he pleases with her.

00:05:34.690 --> 00:05:36.860
I beg of you to assist us.

00:05:36.860 --> 00:05:38.480
Very well, I understand.

00:05:38.480 --> 00:05:40.610
The Takeda will offer our assistance.

00:05:40.610 --> 00:05:43.990
Master Sanada, please rest easy.

00:05:43.990 --> 00:05:46.870
I shall be bringing my ninja along as well.

00:05:46.870 --> 00:05:49.290
Your ninja, Venerable Tenkai?

00:05:54.330 --> 00:05:56.790
The movements of the Western Forces...

00:05:57.920 --> 00:06:00.340
It doesn't make sense!

00:06:00.340 --> 00:06:03.050
Certainly, it is unlikely that
Ishida would have done something

00:06:03.050 --> 00:06:06.140
like crush Shikoku in order to use Chosokabe.

00:06:06.140 --> 00:06:09.560
Maybe they're not as
solidly unified as we'd thought.

00:06:09.560 --> 00:06:12.480
Kojuro, maybe we should go check it out.

00:06:12.480 --> 00:06:16.270
Sir? Go where?

00:06:16.270 --> 00:06:18.440
Osaka. Where else?

00:06:23.070 --> 00:06:24.280
Where's Motochika?

00:06:24.280 --> 00:06:25.870
He left.

00:06:25.870 --> 00:06:27.660
Said he was going to settle things.

00:06:27.660 --> 00:06:30.330
I see. That's just like him.

00:06:30.330 --> 00:06:32.410
Yes.

00:06:32.410 --> 00:06:35.420
Ieyasu, I was also...

00:06:35.420 --> 00:06:39.090
...scared of seeing you.

00:06:39.090 --> 00:06:42.590
When I heard that you'd defeated Hideyoshi,

00:06:42.590 --> 00:06:45.760
I thought that you must've changed.

00:06:47.390 --> 00:06:50.060
I have not changed in any way.

00:06:50.060 --> 00:06:53.810
Yeah, Hideyoshi's the one who'd changed.

00:06:53.810 --> 00:06:55.850
I know.

00:06:55.850 --> 00:06:59.150
I'd known all along since that
day we stopped being friends,

00:06:59.150 --> 00:07:01.530
but I wasn't able to accept it.

00:07:01.530 --> 00:07:03.400
Keiji...

00:07:03.400 --> 00:07:05.280
Won't you tell me?

00:07:05.280 --> 00:07:08.870
What were Hideyoshi's last words?

00:07:08.870 --> 00:07:12.200
Lord Hideyoshi's last...

00:07:26.090 --> 00:07:31.600
"Hanbei, what should we aspire to next?"

00:07:31.600 --> 00:07:36.850
That is what Lord Hideyoshi said at the end.

00:07:36.850 --> 00:07:39.190
I see.

00:07:39.190 --> 00:07:45.360
So, with Hanbei, Hideyoshi
remained friends until the end.

00:07:45.360 --> 00:07:49.070
Ieyasu, I was no good.

00:07:49.070 --> 00:07:53.660
I don't want you to make the same mistakes.

00:08:01.920 --> 00:08:03.500
Ieyasu...

00:08:05.760 --> 00:08:07.680
Maeda.

00:08:07.680 --> 00:08:10.510
That gentleman is here,
somewhere in this castle!

00:08:10.510 --> 00:08:12.300
What are you doing here?

00:08:12.300 --> 00:08:15.600
I have found out where your Matsu is.

00:08:15.600 --> 00:08:17.980
Where?! Where's Matsu?!

00:08:17.980 --> 00:08:19.600
Do not get excited.

00:08:19.600 --> 00:08:21.900
She is headed this way right now.

00:08:28.240 --> 00:08:30.950
And here I was wondering
what I'd been summoned for...

00:08:30.950 --> 00:08:33.080
Sneak into Sunpu Castle?

00:08:33.080 --> 00:08:34.910
Talk about a reckless mission.

00:08:34.910 --> 00:08:38.620
Sasuke, you are the only one
who can carry out this mission.

00:08:38.620 --> 00:08:40.210
I'm sure that's true...

00:08:40.750 --> 00:08:42.750
Why must I also be here?

00:08:42.750 --> 00:08:47.090
Because the War God
instructed you to watch over us.

00:08:47.090 --> 00:08:48.630
Which means...

00:08:48.630 --> 00:08:49.630
Hup!

00:08:49.630 --> 00:08:52.680
You were ordered to by your lord, right?

00:08:52.680 --> 00:08:57.180
If Lord Kenshin had not ordered it,
I would not be aiding you folk.

00:08:58.350 --> 00:09:01.690
No matter what happens,
I'll be there to help, without fail.

00:09:01.690 --> 00:09:03.110
That's the promise.

00:09:07.190 --> 00:09:11.110
But anyway... Who's that?

00:09:11.110 --> 00:09:15.370
I have been told that she is
the Venerable Tenkai's ninja...

00:09:15.370 --> 00:09:17.830
<i>She</i> is a ninja?

00:09:17.830 --> 00:09:20.620
Something smells fishy here.

00:09:27.460 --> 00:09:29.260
It is you, Chosokabe.

00:09:29.260 --> 00:09:31.550
I hear you won over the western lands.

00:09:31.550 --> 00:09:33.720
That stuff's not important.

00:09:33.720 --> 00:09:37.260
There's a little something
I wanted to ask you in person.

00:09:37.260 --> 00:09:38.520
What is it?

00:09:38.520 --> 00:09:42.310
Was it you that ordered
the devastation of Shikoku?

00:09:42.310 --> 00:09:44.520
Of what do you speak?

00:09:44.520 --> 00:09:47.270
So, you didn't know, just like I suspected.

00:09:47.270 --> 00:09:49.610
That makes you a figurehead.

00:09:49.610 --> 00:09:51.990
Explain so I can understand.

00:09:51.990 --> 00:09:54.030
The one who devastated my land,

00:09:54.030 --> 00:09:57.540
and killed and stole from me
those that were precious to me...

00:09:57.540 --> 00:09:59.450
...was one of your own!

00:09:59.450 --> 00:10:00.620
What?

00:10:00.620 --> 00:10:03.830
That's why I came to settle things with you.

00:10:03.830 --> 00:10:06.750
Count me out of the Western Forces.

00:10:06.750 --> 00:10:08.590
Betrayal...

00:10:09.420 --> 00:10:11.130
...will not be tolerated!

00:10:12.760 --> 00:10:15.640
Yeah, you didn't know.

00:10:15.640 --> 00:10:18.510
But you guys were the
ones who betrayed me first!

00:10:18.510 --> 00:10:22.020
Or will you give me back
those that were precious to me?

00:10:24.850 --> 00:10:26.230
Be gone!

00:10:26.230 --> 00:10:30.070
Next time we meet on the battlefield,
I will cut you down mercilessly!

00:10:30.070 --> 00:10:32.400
That's my plan, too.

00:10:32.400 --> 00:10:35.360
Those honest eyes of yours...

00:10:35.360 --> 00:10:37.410
Can't say I didn't like them.

00:10:42.710 --> 00:10:44.330
Gyobu.

00:10:44.330 --> 00:10:46.710
Mitsunari, what is the matter?

00:10:46.710 --> 00:10:48.920
Chosokabe left.

00:10:48.920 --> 00:10:50.340
What is this?

00:10:50.340 --> 00:10:54.090
Did you know about the devastation of Shikoku?

00:10:54.090 --> 00:10:56.010
Of what do you speak?

00:10:56.010 --> 00:10:57.720
I will not ask twice.

00:10:57.720 --> 00:11:00.970
Gyobu, do not lie to me.

00:11:02.140 --> 00:11:04.480
So, your answer is that you cannot answer me.

00:11:04.480 --> 00:11:07.350
Do not act behind my back ever again.

00:11:07.350 --> 00:11:09.480
Like Ieyasu did.

00:11:16.700 --> 00:11:18.570
Lord Hideyoshi...

00:11:20.530 --> 00:11:22.370
This is where we go our separate ways.

00:11:22.370 --> 00:11:24.910
What? Your task is to watch over us, right?

00:11:24.910 --> 00:11:29.250
I would be too conspicuous with the rest of you.

00:11:29.250 --> 00:11:31.250
She's become a fine one, that one.

00:11:42.470 --> 00:11:44.180
The Oda Army is standing by outside.

00:11:44.180 --> 00:11:46.390
Kasuga says she's doing her own thing.

00:11:46.390 --> 00:11:47.650
I see.

00:11:47.650 --> 00:11:50.520
It is good that we were able
to sneak into the castle by ourselves,

00:11:50.520 --> 00:11:53.150
but where might we find Lady O-Ichi?

00:11:53.150 --> 00:11:55.030
For that, we may simply ask.

00:11:55.030 --> 00:11:56.990
V-Venerable Tenkai?

00:12:00.660 --> 00:12:01.990
Good evening.

00:12:01.990 --> 00:12:03.700
Wh-Who are you?

00:12:03.700 --> 00:12:05.870
Where might I find Lady O-Ichi?

00:12:05.870 --> 00:12:07.160
Wha...?!

00:12:07.160 --> 00:12:10.630
Tell me, or bid eternal farewell to your body.

00:12:10.630 --> 00:12:13.090
Or rather, to this world, I should say.

00:12:13.090 --> 00:12:15.260
Th-The underground prison...

00:12:15.260 --> 00:12:17.510
Why, thank you.

00:12:22.100 --> 00:12:25.100
Come, let us go to the underground prison.

00:12:37.280 --> 00:12:41.120
Lady O-Ichi, we have come to rescue you!

00:12:54.960 --> 00:12:56.760
The legendary ninja...

00:12:56.760 --> 00:12:58.720
This is a trap!

00:13:08.270 --> 00:13:10.770
Matsu! Matsu!

00:13:10.770 --> 00:13:12.560
Matsu...

00:13:12.560 --> 00:13:14.270
What's wrong?

00:13:14.270 --> 00:13:16.780
It seems she has been drugged or something.

00:13:16.780 --> 00:13:18.650
Not to worry.

00:13:18.650 --> 00:13:20.990
Lady Matsu's person is of great value.

00:13:20.990 --> 00:13:24.070
I would never do anything that might harm it.

00:13:24.070 --> 00:13:26.030
You... can't be...

00:13:26.030 --> 00:13:27.910
My name is Tenkai.

00:13:27.910 --> 00:13:32.040
I am nothing more and nothing less.

00:13:32.040 --> 00:13:34.330
You guys are completely surrounded.

00:13:34.330 --> 00:13:37.800
Give up your futile resistance
and surrender quietly!

00:13:39.050 --> 00:13:40.380
Do you think we would

00:13:40.380 --> 00:13:42.930
march into the enemy's main
stronghold without any insurance?

00:13:42.930 --> 00:13:44.260
What?!

00:13:47.310 --> 00:13:49.350
Lady O-Ichi!

00:13:49.350 --> 00:13:50.770
We are under attack!

00:13:50.770 --> 00:13:52.190
The banner is that of the Oda!

00:13:52.190 --> 00:13:54.190
Huh?! What did you just say?!

00:13:54.190 --> 00:13:56.360
The Oda! It is the Oda!

00:13:58.190 --> 00:14:00.190
Wait, for real?

00:14:00.190 --> 00:14:02.360
Give Matsu back!

00:14:03.860 --> 00:14:06.450
What are you planning to make Matsu do?!

00:14:06.450 --> 00:14:13.210
For old times' sake, I am having
Lady Matsu lead me to Lady O-Ichi.

00:14:13.210 --> 00:14:16.750
What do we do, Commander? At this rate...

00:14:16.750 --> 00:14:19.300
We can neither advance nor retreat as we wish.

00:14:26.930 --> 00:14:28.600
The man of my destiny...

00:14:28.600 --> 00:14:31.680
Where is the man of gloaming feathers?

00:14:32.850 --> 00:14:34.770
Is someone there?

00:14:41.990 --> 00:14:43.320
Wha...

00:14:43.320 --> 00:14:45.820
What is all this?

00:14:50.870 --> 00:14:53.960
Is that you... Ranmaru?

00:14:53.960 --> 00:14:55.670
There aren't that many of them!

00:14:55.670 --> 00:14:58.000
Shoot them with your arquebuses!

00:15:01.380 --> 00:15:03.260
Curse you, Tokugawa!

00:15:03.260 --> 00:15:05.880
We will not retreat until
we have rescued Lady O-Ichi!

00:15:13.270 --> 00:15:16.600
Ranmaru, you've come to visit me?

00:15:18.610 --> 00:15:20.070
Stop...

00:15:21.690 --> 00:15:24.780
Wh-What is it? Do these hurt?

00:15:42.090 --> 00:15:43.210
Wh-Who are you?!

00:15:43.210 --> 00:15:45.300
Never mind that! Run!

00:15:50.930 --> 00:15:52.890
Secret Rite, Banishing Darkness!

00:15:52.560 --> 00:15:52.600
Banishing

00:15:52.600 --> 00:15:52.640
Banishing

00:15:52.600 --> 00:15:52.640
Darkness

00:15:52.640 --> 00:15:52.680
Banishing

00:15:52.640 --> 00:15:52.680
Darkness

00:15:52.680 --> 00:15:52.720
Banishing

00:15:52.680 --> 00:15:52.720
Darkness

00:15:52.720 --> 00:15:52.760
Banishing

00:15:52.720 --> 00:15:52.760
Darkness

00:15:52.760 --> 00:15:53.640
Banishing

00:15:52.760 --> 00:15:53.640
Darkness

00:15:53.890 --> 00:15:56.770
You will not be able to escape from this spell!

00:16:10.240 --> 00:16:11.160
What is that?

00:16:11.160 --> 00:16:12.740
Something isn't right...

00:16:12.740 --> 00:16:17.210
At long last, it seems Lady O-Ichi has awakened.

00:16:17.210 --> 00:16:18.540
What are you talking about?

00:16:18.540 --> 00:16:19.630
O-Ichi?

00:16:19.630 --> 00:16:22.040
It is finally about to begin.

00:16:24.550 --> 00:16:26.340
The barrier around Lady O-Ichi...

00:16:26.340 --> 00:16:29.340
Retreat! Retreat! Retreat! It's not safe here!

00:16:29.340 --> 00:16:30.510
It is Lady O-Ichi!

00:16:30.510 --> 00:16:33.430
The ladyship has returned to us!

00:16:33.430 --> 00:16:35.180
Most mysterious!

00:16:42.230 --> 00:16:44.860
What in the hell is going on?

00:16:54.330 --> 00:16:55.240
Where...

00:16:55.240 --> 00:16:58.250
Apparently, we're underground
beneath Sunpu Castle.

00:16:58.250 --> 00:17:01.040
Commander, do you see that?

00:17:01.040 --> 00:17:02.500
That is...

00:17:06.880 --> 00:17:07.840
Kasuga?!

00:17:07.840 --> 00:17:09.380
Goodness...

00:17:11.640 --> 00:17:12.720
O-Ichi...

00:17:12.720 --> 00:17:14.470
The Devil Lord's younger sister?

00:17:14.470 --> 00:17:19.770
Lady O-Ichi, we are coming to your rescue!

00:17:19.770 --> 00:17:23.110
Beautiful... flowers...

00:17:25.190 --> 00:17:29.240
Wh-What are you doing, Venerable Tenkai?

00:17:29.240 --> 00:17:31.950
This is all for your sakes.

00:17:33.990 --> 00:17:37.330
Oh, and they fade away...

00:17:37.330 --> 00:17:40.460
All of them, fading away...

00:17:46.420 --> 00:17:48.210
Rejoice.

00:17:48.210 --> 00:17:51.470
You are to become the cornerstones...

00:17:51.470 --> 00:17:53.300
...of Oda's resurrection.

00:17:53.300 --> 00:17:56.350
The resurrection of Oda?
What do you think you're doing?!

00:17:56.350 --> 00:17:58.770
I should have elaborated.

00:17:58.770 --> 00:18:00.980
All those who once served under
Oda were, from the very beginning,

00:18:00.980 --> 00:18:04.480
the flesh and blood of the
Devil King of the Sixth Heaven.

00:18:04.480 --> 00:18:07.820
By taking their flesh and blood,
and pouring it all into Lady O-Ichi,

00:18:07.820 --> 00:18:11.030
who stands at the threshold
between realms and times,

00:18:11.030 --> 00:18:15.370
Lord Nobunaga's body... his soul...

00:18:15.370 --> 00:18:19.120
Oh! They will be resurrected!

00:18:19.120 --> 00:18:20.950
Of the Sixth Heaven?!

00:18:20.950 --> 00:18:24.460
Oh! And once more...

00:18:24.460 --> 00:18:26.590
Just as we were back then...

00:18:28.210 --> 00:18:31.340
Matsu, a woman formerly of the Oda...

00:18:31.340 --> 00:18:33.090
You, as well.

00:18:33.090 --> 00:18:34.590
Stop!

00:18:34.590 --> 00:18:37.220
Have you lost your mind, Venerable Tenkai?!

00:18:37.220 --> 00:18:39.350
Lost my mind?

00:18:39.350 --> 00:18:42.270
You know nothing, so do not get in my way!

00:18:42.270 --> 00:18:44.390
Be that as it may, to turn
your blade on your allies...

00:18:44.390 --> 00:18:46.900
Takeda commander, you've got my thanks!

00:18:54.650 --> 00:18:55.860
Maeda!

00:18:55.860 --> 00:18:57.240
Right!

00:19:01.200 --> 00:19:04.710
Commander, time for us to retreat, too!

00:19:04.710 --> 00:19:06.250
Understood!

00:19:35.280 --> 00:19:38.120
To think we were unable
to save Mistress Kasuga...

00:19:39.160 --> 00:19:42.080
Matsu! Matsu!

00:19:44.960 --> 00:19:47.120
K-Keiji...

00:19:47.120 --> 00:19:48.750
Matsu!

00:19:51.130 --> 00:19:52.840
Matsu...

00:19:58.890 --> 00:20:00.390
Sawayama Mountain

00:19:58.890 --> 00:20:00.390
Toyotomi Hideyoshi's Grave

00:19:58.890 --> 00:20:00.390
m -4 -4 l 1284 -4 1284 724 -4 724

00:20:01.810 --> 00:20:03.430
Lord Hideyoshi,

00:20:03.430 --> 00:20:07.440
as unenlightened as I am,
the strength to lead an army...

00:20:08.730 --> 00:20:10.310
...is something I do not have.

00:20:10.310 --> 00:20:13.190
I... I...

00:20:16.900 --> 00:20:20.910
I had a feeling that I would
get to see you if I came here.

00:20:20.910 --> 00:20:23.370
Ieyasu!

00:20:24.660 --> 00:20:26.450
Please hear what I have to say!

00:20:26.450 --> 00:20:29.290
I do not wish to fight you!

00:20:29.290 --> 00:20:31.790
You are the one who destroyed Lord Hideyoshi!

00:20:31.790 --> 00:20:34.420
And for you to speak against
fighting before Lord Hideyoshi's grave...

00:20:34.420 --> 00:20:36.090
Your lack of respect is unforgivable!

00:20:36.090 --> 00:20:39.470
But we can still stop this war.

00:20:39.470 --> 00:20:41.800
You and I just have to resolve to do so.

00:20:41.800 --> 00:20:44.180
Do you mean to mock me?!

00:20:44.180 --> 00:20:46.560
You are the one who began this war!

00:20:46.560 --> 00:20:50.190
Hang your guilty head and be cut down by me...

00:20:50.190 --> 00:20:53.320
There is no other way I can sheath this blade!

00:20:53.320 --> 00:20:55.820
I am begging you! Hear me out!

00:20:55.820 --> 00:20:57.360
You!

00:20:58.200 --> 00:21:00.030
You! You!

00:21:00.030 --> 00:21:03.120
This was all begun by <i>you</i>!

00:21:04.080 --> 00:21:05.450
Are you running away?!

00:21:05.450 --> 00:21:07.410
This fight is not yet over!

00:21:07.410 --> 00:21:10.330
Halt, Ieyasu!

00:21:10.330 --> 00:21:13.460
Mitsunari, I will see you
where we promised to meet!

00:21:15.250 --> 00:21:17.380
Where we promised to meet...

